      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would probably also be intertwined with [SteamVR Binding Actions](https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Guides:SteamVR_Bindings#Actions). I'd love some parameters dedicated to grip n trigger.\n\nI also struggled with gesture consistency on Index so I rebound them to act more like Vive Wands. Open hand = Grip squeeze, Fist = Trigger, All other gestures via touchpad split into a pie radial. It also disables pose gestures. \n\nhttps://github.com/ZenithVal/SteamVR-Bindings/blob/main/VRChat/VRChat_Index%20-%20Viveified.json",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
